        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Jewel Spirits&quot; is a new type of game that incorporates elements of party-building roguelite into turn-based strategy (strategic simulation RPG).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a journey with your jewel spirits to explore the anomalies of the &quot;Great Crystal of Time&quot; in the innermost part of the gem cave!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose your favorite jewel spirits and organize your party</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are only two jewel spirits, Ruby and Sapphire, to start the adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can add new jewel spirits to your party as you advance through the caves, defeating the demons that stand in your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The jewel spirits that you casually add to your group may turn out to be of unexpected use.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find a combination of jewel spirits that go well with each other and create your own unique and powerful party!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > The key to battle is to &quot;switch&quot; gem spirits! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In battle, not all of the jewel spirits you have chosen as your allies can be put on the field, but it is possible to &quot;switch&quot; with a reserve ally during battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are various strategies that can be taken, such as replacing the most compatible jewel spirit depending on the enemy, or extending the distance of movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the &quot;Switching&quot; function to play with the demons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Replayable, so you can play over and over again! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All the candidates for the jewel spirits you can join and the items you can obtain are all random.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a play experience that changes as you play!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Streaming Guidelines</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We welcome the posting and live streaming of gameplay videos on video sharing platforms and social media, regardless of whether you are an individual or a company.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are also free to monetize your content—such as through ads or donations—if your videos include your own creative input, such as commentary or other personal touches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Please refrain from using the game in ways that violate public order and morals.</i></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Jewel Spirits&quot; is a new type of game that incorporates elements of party-building roguelite into turn-based strategy (strategic simulation RPG).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a journey with your jewel spirits to explore the anomalies of the &quot;Great Crystal of Time&quot; in the innermost part of the gem cave!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose your favorite jewel spirits and organize your party</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are only two jewel spirits, Ruby and Sapphire, to start the adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can add new jewel spirits to your party as you advance through the caves, defeating the demons that stand in your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The jewel spirits that you casually add to your group may turn out to be of unexpected use.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find a combination of jewel spirits that go well with each other and create your own unique and powerful party!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > The key to battle is to &quot;switch&quot; gem spirits! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In battle, not all of the jewel spirits you have chosen as your allies can be put on the field, but it is possible to &quot;switch&quot; with a reserve ally during battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are various strategies that can be taken, such as replacing the most compatible jewel spirit depending on the enemy, or extending the distance of movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the &quot;Switching&quot; function to play with the demons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Replayable, so you can play over and over again! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All the candidates for the jewel spirits you can join and the items you can obtain are all random.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a play experience that changes as you play!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Streaming Guidelines</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We welcome the posting and live streaming of gameplay videos on video sharing platforms and social media, regardless of whether you are an individual or a company.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are also free to monetize your content—such as through ads or donations—if your videos include your own creative input, such as commentary or other personal touches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Please refrain from using the game in ways that violate public order and morals.</i></p>",
        "short_description": "&quot;Jewel Spirits&quot; is a new type of game that combines turn-based strategy (strategic simulation RPG) with party-building roguelite elements. Build a party of jewel spirits with unique abilities and kick demons to the curb with your own unique composition!",
